{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everdark</strong> is a fast-paced first-person shooter that blends intense action with classic survival horror. Inspired by legendary titles like <i>Unreal</i>, <i>Doom</i>, and <i>Resident Evil</i>, Everdark is also a love letter to '80s horror movies\u2014featuring vampires, blood, and a uniquely haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.poster.avif?t=1770143421\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.webm?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.mp4?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Everdark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way back from visiting your cousin in Milwaukee, a wrong turn leads you to the cursed town of Everdark. After a car crash, you're stranded\u2014cut off from the outside world. Your only option is to escape on foot\u2026 but the streets are crawling with vampires.<br>Fight for survival, help other survivors, and uncover the truth behind the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.poster.avif?t=1770143421\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.webm?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.mp4?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>High-octane FPS gameplay</strong> with a gritty \u201880s horror vibe<br>\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Classic survival horror mechanics</strong>: limited ammo, scarce resources, and clever puzzles<br>\ud83e\udddb <strong>15 hand-crafted levels</strong> packed with bloodthirsty enemies, secrets, and plot twists<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Vampire-slaying combat</strong>: weaken them with weapons, finish them with a stake to the heart<br>\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Unique arsenal</strong>: firearms, melee weapons, holy water, garlic, crucifixes, and wooden stakes<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>The beginning of a new saga</strong>: Everdark is the first chapter in a shared universe with much more to come</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.poster.avif?t=1770143421\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.webm?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.mp4?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everdark</strong> is your ticket to a brutal, atmospheric, and nostalgic horror shooter. If you love intense FPS action, survival challenges, and stories dripping with dark lore\u2014you won't want to miss this. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Librarian.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/777f0d41198352cac86ae64e230b3f80bae91b8c.jpg"},{"name":"Building bridges.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/f3361cce758d1b88d9fd9d0be777ea7c196298f4.jpg"},{"name":"First communion.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/3e96ce729e2513d51cd95c106389637a63f01d78.jpg"},{"name":"The mummy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/39231e4acae76dda79fc73d71448925ef3e8e373.jpg"},{"name":"Freeze!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/2357cd83b23b4dc181190ae7ec8a269513dd3572.jpg"},{"name":"Shop Smart, Shop S-Mart.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/7aada5dae9aa1c1c334793adfa0c8714ee8a9981.jpg"},{"name":"The mummy returns.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/34f6183ca253e40f6e0f33827405584b95cb76f0.jpg"},{"name":"Cough syrup.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/47fa9cffef34cd8176b61caf7e2026c7d59c760a.jpg"},{"name":"I'll be back.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/950821ef9f321baed7aa320c4a392bb0d471637f.jpg"},{"name":"In the stockade.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3324980/9fae745d28ca5953ecf0fe791ef74df6aff51f4f.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324980?t=1770143421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324980?t=1770143421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/a0f5c3a4f48fd48d79da5abaae61e60d8890889e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770143421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/a0f5c3a4f48fd48d79da5abaae61e60d8890889e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770143421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or inappropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3628490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the nightmare.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everdark</strong> is a fast-paced first-person shooter that blends intense action with classic survival horror. Inspired by legendary titles like <i>Unreal</i>, <i>Doom</i>, and <i>Resident Evil</i>, Everdark is also a love letter to '80s horror movies\u2014featuring vampires, blood, and a uniquely haunting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.poster.avif?t=1770143421\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.webm?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/eb70f9705187298816001f734b834b02.mp4?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Everdark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way back from visiting your cousin in Milwaukee, a wrong turn leads you to the cursed town of Everdark. After a car crash, you're stranded\u2014cut off from the outside world. Your only option is to escape on foot\u2026 but the streets are crawling with vampires.<br>Fight for survival, help other survivors, and uncover the truth behind the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.poster.avif?t=1770143421\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.webm?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/6d98e6f3f4ac0a72d250c92e121e7f05.mp4?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 <strong>High-octane FPS gameplay</strong> with a gritty \u201880s horror vibe<br>\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Classic survival horror mechanics</strong>: limited ammo, scarce resources, and clever puzzles<br>\ud83e\udddb <strong>15 hand-crafted levels</strong> packed with bloodthirsty enemies, secrets, and plot twists<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Vampire-slaying combat</strong>: weaken them with weapons, finish them with a stake to the heart<br>\ud83e\uddf0 <strong>Unique arsenal</strong>: firearms, melee weapons, holy water, garlic, crucifixes, and wooden stakes<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>The beginning of a new saga</strong>: Everdark is the first chapter in a shared universe with much more to come</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.poster.avif?t=1770143421\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.webm?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/extras/9db580d91d0de979a8952fc45b15b021.mp4?t=1770143421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everdark</strong> is your ticket to a brutal, atmospheric, and nostalgic horror shooter. If you love intense FPS action, survival challenges, and stories dripping with dark lore\u2014you won't want to miss this. </p>","developers":["ESDIP_GAMES","Everdark Labs"],"dlc":[4224000,4381430],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324980/header.jpg?t=1770143421","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"EVERDARK: Undead Apocalypse \u00a9 2025 Developed by ESDIP_GAMES. Published 2025 by Dojo System S.L. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are property of their respective owners. All rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324980/1902445206/84ff13ffd7f72eba8275fb045cae593384edca2b/1765456719/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765462270","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324980/1902445206/84ff13ffd7f72eba8275fb045cae593384edca2b/1765456719/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765462270","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324980/1902445206/84ff13ffd7f72eba8275fb045cae593384edca2b/1765456719/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765462270","id":257247457,"name":"FINAL TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247457/40e9f3047600cc74fb92e42a81704f871f576bef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765462270"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324980/349059338/d2991e22358202cb77a8bb8841f219708483c90c/1764774806/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764775991","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3324980/349059338/d2991e22358202cb77a8bb8841f219708483c90c/1